  "long_description": "A native port of Gameloft's **Dungeon Hunter 3** (Android, v1.5.2c) to the PlayStation Vita, built on the so-loader technique: the original Android `libDH3.so` is relocated and run directly on the Vita, with a FalsoJNI-based bridge standing in for the parts of the Android runtime the game calls into (Java callbacks, file system, OBB, input, audio, video, IME), rendering through a patched vitaGL built from source.",
